      "page": 5,
      "figure_number": "2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Representative EIS data and modeling results Top: impedance spectra of a representative SSB cell, EIS measured at 0% SOC, cell cycled with 0.1 C, with marked impedance data points in the low-, middle-, and high-frequency range over a number of different cycles. Lower left: measured and diagnosed relative discharged capacity using Gaussian process regression (GPR), with DRT instructed feature engineering, data divided into training, cross validation (CV), and test sets. Lower right: measured and predicted relative discharged capacity after next 10 cycles using Bayesian regression (BR), with DRT instructed feature engineering, data divided into training, CV, and test sets.",
